/T (This chapter describes the experimental setup and tools used to analyze the performance of Single-Cycle and Pipelined RISC-V processors. It explains the simulation platform and system configuration used to carry out the experiments.The analysis is performed using a simulation-based approach, where RISC-V assembly programs are executed on both processor models. The simulator helps in observing internal processor operations such as instruction flow, pipeline stages, and register updates.)
/E (This chapter describes the experimental setup and tools used to analyze the performance of Single-Cycle and Pipelined RISC-V processors. It explains the simulation platform and system configuration used to carry out the experiments.The analysis is performed using a simulation-based approach, where RISC-V assembly programs are executed on both processor models. The simulator helps in observing internal processor operations such as instruction flow, pipeline stages, and register updates.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
