/T (The primary tool used in this project is the Ripes Simulator. It is a graphical computer architecture simulator designed to demonstrate the working of RISC-V processors in an interactive manner. Ripes provides a detailed visualization of how instructions are executed inside the processor. It allows users to observe different stages of instruction execution and understand the internal behavior of both Single-Cycle and Pipelined architectures.)
/E (The primary tool used in this project is the Ripes Simulator. It is a graphical computer architecture simulator designed to demonstrate the working of RISC-V processors in an interactive manner. Ripes provides a detailed visualization of how instructions are executed inside the processor. It allows users to observe different stages of instruction execution and understand the internal behavior of both Single-Cycle and Pipelined architectures.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
