<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 155 0 R
/T (CHAPTER 6 RESULTS The following sections provide a detailed analysis of the simulation runs conducted using the Ripes RISC-V ISA Simulator. For each configuration, a screenshot of the visual cache management interface is provided to illustrate the real-time interaction between the processor and the memory hierarchy. These visuals include the cache table, which shows data placement and tag matching, and the performance plot, which tracks the cumulative Cache Hit Ratio over the execution cycles. By examining these screenshots sequentially, we can observe the empirical transition from high miss rates at small block sizes to optimized performance as spatial locality is effectively exploited.)
/E (CHAPTER 6 RESULTS The following sections provide a detailed analysis of the simulation runs conducted using the Ripes RISC-V ISA Simulator. For each configuration, a screenshot of the visual cache management interface is provided to illustrate the real-time interaction between the processor and the memory hierarchy. These visuals include the cache table, which shows data placement and tag matching, and the performance plot, which tracks the cumulative Cache Hit Ratio over the execution cycles. By examining these screenshots sequentially, we can observe the empirical transition from high miss rates at small block sizes to optimized performance as spatial locality is effectively exploited.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
