<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 165 0 R
/T (By executing a data-intensive array-traversal algorithm, practical experience was gained in identifying the performance "sweet spot" where system efficiency peaks. The simulation results clearly illustrate the trade-offs between memory bandwidth and cache pollution, providing a strong foundation for learning modern Computer Organization and Architecture \(COA\). Ultimately, this study stands as a powerful educational tool that reinforces essential concepts of hardware-software interaction and memory management crucial for any aspiring computer engineer.)
/E (By executing a data-intensive array-traversal algorithm, practical experience was gained in identifying the performance "sweet spot" where system efficiency peaks. The simulation results clearly illustrate the trade-offs between memory bandwidth and cache pollution, providing a strong foundation for learning modern Computer Organization and Architecture \(COA\). Ultimately, this study stands as a powerful educational tool that reinforces essential concepts of hardware-software interaction and memory management crucial for any aspiring computer engineer.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
642 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 165 0 R
/T (The empirical analysis of cache block size on spatial locality and system hit rates successfully demonstrates the fundamental principles of the memory hierarchy within a processor. Through the use of the Ripes RISC-V ISA Simulator, a complete understanding of how varying the block size impacts the overall Cache Hit Ratio has been achieved. The project not only emphasizes the importance of exploiting spatial locality to reduce compulsory misses but also showcases how an optimized configuration can significantly enhance CPU execution efficiency.)
/E (The empirical analysis of cache block size on spatial locality and system hit rates successfully demonstrates the fundamental principles of the memory hierarchy within a processor. Through the use of the Ripes RISC-V ISA Simulator, a complete understanding of how varying the block size impacts the overall Cache Hit Ratio has been achieved. The project not only emphasizes the importance of exploiting spatial locality to reduce compulsory misses but also showcases how an optimized configuration can significantly enhance CPU execution efficiency.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
