/Title (This certifies that the project report titled "Performance Analysis of Single-Cycle and Pipelined RISC-V Processor" represents the genuine work carried out by the group members: Gayatri N C \(VAS24CS111\), Athulkrishna S \(LVAS24CS203\), Asha E R \(VAS24CS076\) and Devanandhan A B \(VAS24CS098\), of Vidya Academy of Science & Technology, Thalakkottukara, Thrissur - 680 501. This report is formally submitted as a required project component for the Computer Organization and Architecture \(PBCST404\) course, as part of the B.Tech program \(2024-2028 batch\) prescribed by APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University \(APJAKTU\), during the 2025-2026 academic year. The project work has been completed and accepted as meeting the stipulated academic requirements for the subject's project.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1151 0 R
/Next 1914 0 R
>>
