/Title (The empirical analysis of cache block size on spatial locality and system hit rates successfully demonstrates the fundamental principles of the memory hierarchy within a processor. Through the use of the Ripes RISC-V ISA Simulator, a complete understanding of how varying the block size impacts the overall Cache Hit Ratio has been achieved. The project not only emphasizes the importance of exploiting spatial locality to reduce compulsory misses but also showcases how an optimized configuration can significantly enhance CPU execution efficiency.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1152 0 R
/Next 1919 0 R
>>
endobj
