1915 0 obj
<<
/Title (During the course of our mini project, our team of four collaborated closely, and we also received support from various individuals, both directly and indirectly. Without their valuable contributions, completing this work would have been impossible. We would like to take this opportunity to express our sincere gratitude and appreciation for their support. We want to start expressing my thanks to my project guide Ms. Remya Krishna J S, Assistant Professor, Dept. of Computer Science and Engineering , because of her valuable advice and guidance towards this work. We received motivation, encouragement and hold up from her during the course of work. We are grateful to express my thanks to all the faculty members of our department for their support. I articulate my gratitude to all my friends for their support and help for this work. We are thankful to Dr. Sajay K R, Head of Computer Science and Engineering Engineering Department, and our Principal Dr. Sunitha C for their sole co-operation. Last, but not the least we wish to express our gratitude to God Almighty for his abundant blessings without which this effort would not have been successful.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
