1918 0 obj
<<
/Title (Graph Observation: The graph shows a very sharp initial climb followed by a steady high-altitude plateau. This confirms that the system has reached the "sweet spot" where the Cache Hit Ratio is maximized.)
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2165 0 R
/Next 1610 0 R
>>
endobj
1919 0 obj
<<
/Title (By executing a data-intensive array-traversal algorithm, practical experience was gained in identifying the performance "sweet spot" where system efficiency peaks. The simulation results clearly illustrate the trade-offs between memory bandwidth and cache pollution, providing a strong foundation for learning modern Computer Organization and Architecture \(COA\). Ultimately, this study stands as a powerful educational tool that reinforces essential concepts of hardware-software interaction and memory management crucial for any aspiring computer engineer.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1152 0 R
/Prev 1611 0 R
/Next 2166 0 R
>>
endobj
